  <!-- EN: tiny mammoth -->
  <DMS_Mech_Mammoth.label>小猛玛</DMS_Mech_Mammoth.label>
  <!-- EN: an unmanned tracked armed carrier used for armed transportation. It is used to transport ammunition and supplies to the front line. It has a certain self-protection capability and a high endurance, which makes them often used by colonial fleets for caravan transportation in rimworld. -->
  <DMS_Mech_Mammoth.description>一种用于武装运输的无人履带运输车。用于向前线运送弹药和补给。它具有一定的自卫能力和较高的续航能力，因此经常被边缘世界的殖民舰队用于商队的运输。</DMS_Mech_Mammoth.description>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <DMS_Mech_Mammoth.tools.head.label>头部</DMS_Mech_Mammoth.tools.head.label>
  
